WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.550
The detector was trained on drawings

2
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.290
with the eyes close together.

3
00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.610
A wider face is still a face, and

4
00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.250
it was never in that average.

5
00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.510
Today: who a detector misses, and

6
00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.470
why a high score on the training

7
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.850
shape is not enough.

8
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.410
The score is how close a picture is to

9
00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.350
the average of the training faces.

10
00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.110
The line is the same for every picture.

11
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.520
The wide face falls below the line.

12
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.280
The box stays below it too,

13
00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.060
and that part is correct.

14
00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.450
A test on only the training

15
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.070
shape hides the miss.

16
00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.810
These are drawings, not

17
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:42.710
anyone's photograph.

18
00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.500
Close-set eyes sit in the average.

19
00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.720
Spread them out and the score drops,

20
00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.100
even though it is still a face.

21
00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:53.940
Quick check!

22
00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.960
The detector trained on close-set eyes.

23
00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.990
A wider drawn face scores where?

24
00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:03.150
Below the line.

25
00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:07.090
Same idea, wider spacing, and

26
00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:08.490
the match falls short.

27
00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:11.480
In the app, open the detector.

28
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.360
Read the three test scores and

29
00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.840
say which face was missed.

30
00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:17.850
Your turn.

31
00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:20.770
Is a high score on the training shape

32
00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:23.630
enough to trust a detector on new people?

33
00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:25.640
Remember this.

34
00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:27.540
Report who was missed.

35
00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:30.430
Do not test a face detector on

36
00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:31.870
real photographs of people.

37
00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:33.910
Try it tonight.

38
00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:36.630
Write the line and the wide

39
00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:38.290
face's score from the lab.
